# OpenAI API Configuration
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Copy this file to `.env` (do NOT commit that file) and set your real key.
# Read via react-native-config as Config.OPENAI_API_KEY — rebuild the app
# (not just reload JS) after changing this file.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-actual-key-here
